WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:11.207
After escaping from the police van, Arsène Lupin had run for a few steps, but once he was

2
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:18.207
on the sidewalk, he walked leisurely, like a casual stroller in the city. He whistled happily, greeted other

3
00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:28.017
pedestrians with nods, and headed to a nearby sidewalk cafe. The beautiful autumn day attracted many to these

4
00:00:28.018 --> 00:00:32.612
outdoor restaurants, but Lupin found a seat right away and ordered a glass of the most expensive wine.

5
00:00:32.613 --> 00:00:38.183
When his glass was almost empty, Lupin called for the cafe owner. "Yes, monsieur, what can I do

6
00:00:38.184 --> 00:00:46.437
for you?" the owner asked when he arrived at Lupin’s table. In a voice loud enough for all to

7
00:00:46.438 --> 00:00:56.326
