8
00:00:56.327 --> 00:01:05.668
very recognizable, you will accept an IOU. My name is Arsène Lupin." The owner thought he was joking.

9
00:01:05.669 --> 00:01:17.897
"I am Lupin, once a prisoner at Santé Prison but now a fugitive," said Lupin emphatically. "I’m sure

10
00:01:17.898 --> 00:01:27.064
my name inspires your complete confidence in me." Then he got up and walked away as the other

11
00:01:27.065 --> 00:01:32.310
diners burst into laughter and the owner stood there amazed. Later that afternoon Monsieur Dudouis, chief of the

12
00:01:32.311 --> 00:01:39.319
Paris police, stood staring blankly at the awards on an office wall at Santé Prison. "Those awards won’t

13
00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:45.874
mean anything if Lupin is not found," he thought. Dudouis had come to the prison to investigate how

14
00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:55.961
Arsène Lupin had accomplished the impossible when a miracle happened. A guard burst into the office, shouting, "He

15
