00:02:08.533 --> 00:02:15.699
you how and why?" said the police chief through clenched teeth. "I did it because I could do it,"

18
00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:19.770
Lupin retorted with a sly smile. "I will not be mocked!" cried Dudouis angrily. "Go explain yourself to

19
00:02:19.771 --> 00:02:28.770
Judge Bouvier!" The chief then ordered Lupin to be taken to the judge immediately. After Lupin had left,

20
