at that precise moment, Paris was hungrily devouring a special edition of the newspaper Echo de France .

22
00:02:43.660 --> 00:03:03.397
This newspaper seemed to concentrate exclusively on the exploits of Arsène Lupin. In this edition the Echo printed

23
