Judge Bouvier. But rather than being impressed, the judge laughed scornfully. "Why are you laughing?" Lupin demanded. He

28
00:03:46.615 --> 00:03:56.193
was annoyed that the judge didn’t seem to know that even the great detective Ganimard had applauded Lupin’s

29
