00:04:49.987 --> 00:05:01.391
was transferred to another cell and two new guards were posted to watch his every move. The judge

38
00:05:01.392 --> 00:05:08.216
closed the investigation and no further action was taken for two months. Lupin did not raise any objections,

39
00:05:08.217 --> 00:05:18.446
and after his return, he seemed cheerless and subdued, spending most of his time lying on his cot

40
00:05:18.447 --> 00:05:23.692
with his face to the wall. He hardly spoke and rarely even ate. He seemed to have lost his

41
00:05:23.693 --> 00:05:31.938
zest for life. Public curiosity had only become stronger as the date of Lupin’s trial neared, and everyone

42
