thought the infamous prisoner would indeed escape again. People anticipated a lively trial bubbling with Lupin’s charisma and

43
00:05:37.534 --> 00:05:52.176
genius. On the opening day of the trial, enormous crowds gathered on benches in the courtroom, anxious to

44
00:05:52.177 --> 00:05:56.343
see the dashing gentleman burglar. But the prisoner who walked in was a complete contrast to what the

45
