public expected. He walked in slowly with his head bent down, long hair covering his face, and his

46
00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:02.089
clothes hanging loosely on his thin body. Then he sat down solemnly next to his lawyer. "The prisoner

47
00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:08.756
