continued, "As for your real name and identity, that is a mystery. You appeared in our city three years

52
00:06:32.733 --> 00:06:41.470
ago, and we believe you were a man called Rostat, who worked alongside the great magician Hugo. We

53
00:06:41.471 --> 00:06:49.113
also believe you were a Russian student named Vladimir, who worked with the famed bacteriologist Dr. Altier. You

54
00:06:49.114 --> 00:07:04.867
were the professor who introduced Japanese martial arts to the people of Paris, the cyclist who won the

55
