Grand Prix━who, after receiving his prize, was never seen again━and the person who saved many people from a

56
00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.676
deadly fire while picking their pockets. We have evidence that all these people are one and the same━Arsène

57
00:07:13.677 --> 00:07:22.089
Lupin." The people in the courtroom whispered to each other. "As you see, you are not as clever

58
