as you think," said the judge. "This, I’m afraid, is the end of your journey." The prisoner remained

59
00:07:28.185 --> 00:07:38.176
silent, his shoulders drooping, and he shifted from one foot to the other. Detective Ganimard was in the

60
00:07:38.177 --> 00:07:47.327
courtroom too, and he observed the actions of the prisoner closely. "This doesn’t look like the man I

61
